> 
> Are you saying that you can't get "You break out of your armour!" when
> wearing DSM? 

> I suppose you'd normally become a dragon - what if you 
> were wearing a RoPC and chose something massive but not dragonlike?

When you're wearing DSM or dragon scales and polymorph without control,
you become a dragon of the colour of your scales/armor.

When you're wearing DSM or dragon scales and polymorph *with* control,
you can specify what to turn into, and if it's too big you break out of
your scales/armor, even if it's GrayDSM. If you're wearing FooDSM and
say "foo dragon" when asked what to polymorph into, you merge with your
scales all right.

(found that out in explore mode; you can do that too, you know)

